[en.FOCUS_C01_ENEMY_AMONG_US]
Friend or Foe?

[en.FOCUS_C01_ENEMY_AMONG_US_desc]
Equalists and old-harmonism supporters are mixed in with the Empire’s citizens. We hope that the ponies who has relevant information can report it voluntarily.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_ENEMY_AMONG_US]
是敌是友？

[zh.FOCUS_C01_ENEMY_AMONG_US_desc]
有平等主义者和旧谐律主义者混在了帝国公民中，希望掌握相关信息的小马们可以自觉举报。

